to prove it to you.

1339
01:13:19.320 --> 01:13:20.606
Will you marry me?

1340
01:13:25.040 --> 01:13:26.644
No!

1341
01:13:28.720 --> 01:13:29.900
Well, yes.

1342
01:13:30.000 --> 01:13:31.340
No!

1343
01:13:31.440 --> 01:13:33.900
- Yes!
- No!

1344
01:13:34.000 --> 01:13:35.220
Yes!

1345
01:13:35.320 --> 01:13:37.100
Come bother me, baby.

1346
