1451
01:22:22.320 --> 01:22:26.442
To be honest, I thought they were lilacs,
but Jackie says they're delphiniums.

1452
01:22:37.960 --> 01:22:40.122
I got a decision I gotta make.

1453
01:22:42.840 --> 01:22:45.969
